  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The authoritative open data source for population health indicators across the Americas, maintained by PAHO (WHO regional office) with 30+ years of longitudinal data. Production-grade, intergovernmentally governed, and freely accessible for non-commercial and research use under CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO. Adopt for public health research, surveillance, and SDG monitoring in the Americas region. Note: the NC clause restricts commercial applications — verify compliance before use in a commercial product.",
